WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.210
SCP-682 Vs SCP-536.

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:08.170
The Hard to Destroy Reptile seems to ignore
the laws of physics most of the time, but

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:13.380
how will he fare when the Foundation uses
the SCP-536 chamber to manipulate the laws

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.400
of physics around it?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.600
SCP-682’s containment tank was moved into
the 536 chamber.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.730
The speed of light, fundamental charge, and
nuclear force were increased progressively

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.730
over time.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:30.420
The chamber was utterly annihilated in seconds,
but even when the process was done, and 682

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.600
was reduced to 1% of its normal size, it was
still alive.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.950
One of the researchers lost it from the frustration
and began turning all the dials to torture

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.950
the creature.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:43.700
He was removed from the cross-testing room,
but was later forgiven for his indiscretions

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:49.120
- with his supervisor noting that he would
have done the same, seeing as at times, 682

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.329
seemed almost like it enjoyed the process.

